# API Standards

## HTTP Methods

GET → Retrieve

POST → Create

PUT → Replace

PATCH → Partial Update

DELETE → Remove

## Status Codes

200 → OK

201 → Created

204 → No Content

400 → Bad Request

401 → Unauthorized

403 → Forbidden

404 → Not Found

409 → Conflict

500 → Internal Server Error

