# Forbidden Practices

Never:

❌ Use any

❌ Place business logic inside controllers

❌ Query Prisma directly inside controllers

❌ Duplicate code

❌ Store passwords without hashing

❌ Skip validation

❌ Expose internal errors

❌ Log sensitive data

❌ Create massive functions

❌ Create monolithic files

❌ Ignore TypeScript errors

❌ Use console.log in production

❌ Return untyped data

